{"id": "2f22e04b-4eb0-493d-a960-70ac711be86d", "slug": "distributed-infrastructure-protocol-2", "title": "Distributed Infrastructure Protocol", "description": "Distributed Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Distributed Infrastructure Protocol\"\ndescription: \"Distributed Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  secondary: \"#E2E8F0\"\n  accent: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  background: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  surface: \"#E2E8F0\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#CBD5E1\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Distributed Infrastructure Protocol\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 1; favorites: 2; remixes: 2.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nDistributed Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nThe heartbeat of decentralized scale 340+ active edge locations mapped € 8.2T total verified settling volume 99.999% system availability SLA 1.2B+ daily compute executions\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The heartbeat of decentralized scale.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #CBD5E1, secondary #E2E8F0, accent #CBD5E1, background #CBD5E1, surface #E2E8F0, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Distributed Infrastructure Protocol</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"font-sans antialiased text-slate-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc 0%, #f1f5f9 35%, #e2e8f0 75%, #cbd5e1 100%);\">\n\n    <!-- Main Structural Container -->\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full flex-grow flex flex-col border-x border-slate-300/60 relative bg-white/30 backdrop-blur-[3px]\">\n\n        <!-- Top Corner Nodes -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[3px] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <header class=\"pt-28 pb-24 px-6 text-center border-b border-slate-300/60 relative z-10\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-tight text-slate-900 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-tight\">\n                The heartbeat of <br> decentralized scale\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Header Bottom Corner Nodes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[3px] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Metrics Section -->\n        <section class=\"border-b border-slate-300/60 relative z-10 bg-white/20\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-slate-300/60 text-center\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-3 py-14 px-6 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-light text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">340+</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700/80 max-w-[160px] leading-relaxed\">\n                        active edge locations mapped\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Internal Grid Node -->\n                    <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute -bottom-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-3 py-14 px-6 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-light text-slate-800/90 tracking-tight\">\n                        <span class=\"text-indigo-500/80 font-extralight mr-1\">€</span>8.2T\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700/80 max-w-[160px] leading-relaxed\">\n                        total verified settling volume\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Internal Grid Node -->\n                    <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute -bottom-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-3 py-14 px-6 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-light text-slate-800/80 tracking-tight\">99.999%</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700/80 max-w-[160px] leading-relaxed\">\n                        system availability SLA\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Internal Grid Node -->\n                    <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute -bottom-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-3 py-14 px-6\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-light text-slate-700/90 tracking-tight\">1.2B+</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700/80 max-w-[160px] leading-relaxed\">\n                        daily compute executions\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Metrics Bottom Corner Nodes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[3px] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Visualization Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow relative overflow-hidden min-h-[500px]\">\n\n            <!-- Interface Controls -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 flex gap-2 z-20\">\n                <button id=\"playbackToggle\" class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-300/60 rounded text-slate-700 transition-all cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Toggle animation\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-300/60 rounded text-slate-700 transition-all cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Configuration\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Visualization Canvas -->\n            <canvas id=\"telemetryCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full block z-0\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Corner Nodes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[3px] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-400/80 z-20\"></div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('telemetryCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n        let width, height;\n        let dataStreams = [];\n        let isAnimating = true;\n        let reqFrameId;\n\n        function handleResize() {\n            width = canvas.clientWidth;\n            height = canvas.clientHeight;\n            canvas.width = width * window.devicePixelRatio;\n            canvas.height = height * window.devicePixelRatio;\n            ctx.scale(window.devicePixelRatio, window.devicePixelRatio);\n            initializeStreams();\n        }\n\n        class DataStream {\n            constructor() {\n                this.reset(true);\n            }\n\n            reset(initial = false) {\n                // Focus radiation outwards\n                this.angle = Math.PI + (Math.random() * Math.PI);\n                if (Math.random() > 0.25) {\n                    this.angle = Math.PI * 1.15 + (Math.random() * Math.PI * 0.7);\n                }\n\n                this.velocity = 0.8 + Math.random() * 3.0;\n                this.depth = initial ? Math.random() * (height * 1.2) : Math.random() * 40;\n                this.maxTrail = 25 + Math.random() * 200;\n                this.trail = 0;\n                this.opacity = 0;\n            }\n\n            update() {\n                this.depth += this.velocity;\n                this.trail = Math.min(this.maxTrail, this.depth * 0.85);\n\n                const ratio = this.depth / (height * 1.2);\n                this.opacity = Math.min(1, this.depth / 120) * Math.max(0, 1 - ratio);\n\n                if (this.depth > height * 1.6) {\n                    this.reset();\n                }\n            }\n\n            render() {\n                const centerX = width / 2;\n                const centerY = height + 60;\n\n                const startX = centerX + Math.cos(this.angle) * this.depth;\n                const startY = centerY + Math.sin(this.angle) * this.depth;\n                const endX = centerX + Math.cos(this.angle) * (this.depth + this.trail);\n                const endY = centerY + Math.sin(this.angle) * (this.depth + this.trail);\n\n                const depthRatio = Math.min(1, this.depth / height);\n                // Shifted hue to Indigo/Slate tones\n                const hue = 230 + (depthRatio * 30);\n                const lightness = 25 + (depthRatio * 40);\n\n                const headColor = `hsla(${hue}, 80%, ${lightness}%, ${this.opacity})`;\n                const tailColor = `hsla(${hue}, 80%, ${Math.max(10, lightness - 20)}%, ${this.opacity * 0.03})`;\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(startX, startY, endX, endY);\n                gradient.addColorStop(0, tailColor);\n                gradient.addColorStop(1, headColor);\n\n                ctx.moveTo(startX, startY);\n                ctx.lineTo(endX, endY);\n                ctx.strokeStyle = gradient;\n                ctx.lineWidth = 0.6 + (depthRatio * 2.2);\n                ctx.stroke();\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(endX, endY, 0.8 + (depthRatio * 1.8), 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fillStyle = `hsla(${hue}, 100%, ${lightness + 15}%, ${this.opacity * 1.2})`;\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initializeStreams() {\n            dataStreams = [];\n            const streamCount = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 120 : 350;\n            for(let i = 0; i < streamCount; i++) {\n                dataStreams.push(new DataStream());\n            }\n        }\n\n        function processFrame() {\n            if (!isAnimating) return;\n\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            dataStreams.forEach(stream => {\n                stream.update();\n                stream.render();\n            });\n\n            reqFrameId = requestAnimationFrame(processFrame);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            cancelAnimationFrame(reqFrameId);\n            handleResize();\n            if(isAnimating) processFrame();\n        });\n\n        handleResize();\n        processFrame();\n\n        const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('playbackToggle');\n        toggleBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n            isAnimating = !isAnimating;\n            if (isAnimating) {\n                toggleBtn.innerHTML = '<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>';\n                processFrame();\n            } else {\n                toggleBtn.innerHTML = '<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>';\n                cancelAnimationFrame(reqFrameId);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "distributed-infrastructure-protocol-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/distributed-infrastructure-protocol-2.jpg", "source_name": "distributed-infrastructure-protocol-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 135, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T21:43:05.162174+00:00"}